WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.080
it was impossible to go back.

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.110
Episode 41

01:38.130 --> 01:39.960
So, black knights were withdrawn

01:40.180 --> 01:41.840
so that Fan Xian got into trouble

01:41.860 --> 01:44.320
because you gave the order, Your Majesty.

01:44.650 --> 01:46.260
If you want to kill Fan Xian,

01:46.260 --> 01:47.580
you just need to issue an imperial edict.

01:47.580 --> 01:49.260
It's unnecessary to drag in so many people

01:49.260 --> 01:51.240
and even send him to Beiqi.

01:52.090 --> 01:53.450
In the final analysis,

01:53.580 --> 01:55.480
he's just a common official.

01:55.500 --> 01:58.050
His life is up to you.

02:00.900 --> 02:02.260
His Majesty sent Fan Xian there

02:02.260 --> 02:04.300
to get the secret out of Xiao En.

02:04.300 --> 02:06.680
How is it related to Fan Xian?

02:07.300 --> 02:09.040
Xiao En has said nothing over the years.

02:09.060 --> 02:11.430
Will he tell Fan Xian about it?

02:11.450 --> 02:13.040
I think so.

02:16.010 --> 02:17.560
You're not bleeding.

02:22.090 --> 02:23.610
Haven't you laughed enough?

02:25.010 --> 02:29.090
Life is full of mysteries and surprises.

02:32.210 --> 02:34.640
Did you save me to get that secret?

02:35.290 --> 02:37.430
I've given up on it.

02:37.450 --> 02:39.730
I saved you for Shangshan Hu.

02:39.900 --> 02:41.530
I fooled him once,

02:41.570 --> 02:43.530
so I have to save you

02:43.700 --> 02:45.640
if I want him to listen to me again.

02:46.260 --> 02:47.890
It makes sense.

02:49.370 --> 02:52.890
You're decisive and cruel.

02:53.730 --> 02:54.930
You're young,

02:54.930 --> 02:56.970
but you'll have a promising future.

02:57.850 --> 02:59.170
But it's of no use.

02:59.850 --> 03:00.900
The wound left by Langtao is so deadly that

03:00.900 --> 03:01.850
even I can't save you.

03:01.850 --> 03:03.730
It's true you're dying.

03:03.930 --> 03:05.060
In this case,

03:05.060 --> 03:06.090
I'll tell you

03:06.090 --> 03:07.560
the secret.

03:08.490 --> 03:09.760
Tell me?

03:09.780 --> 03:10.570
It's a secret,

03:10.570 --> 03:12.010
but actually, it's something simple.

03:12.010 --> 03:13.250
Wait!

03:14.010 --> 03:15.250
What?

03:16.210 --> 03:16.780
I'm going to tell you about it.

03:16.780 --> 03:18.640
Don't you want to listen?

03:19.650 --> 03:21.640
You have no reason to do that.

03:27.850 --> 03:29.560
I'm dying.

03:29.980 --> 03:31.760
Maybe I don't want the secret

03:31.780 --> 03:35.280
to be buried with me.

03:35.820 --> 03:36.650
If that were

03:36.650 --> 03:37.960
what worries you,

03:37.980 --> 03:39.370
you must've told

03:39.370 --> 03:40.810
the Investigator's Office about it.

03:41.060 --> 03:42.890
Maybe it's because of destiny

03:42.980 --> 03:45.610
since it was you that took me back to Beiqi.

03:48.700 --> 03:50.370
And, maybe it's because

03:51.340 --> 03:53.370
I'm moved because you saved me.

03:53.420 --> 03:55.470
You didn't give in even if they threatened to kill you.

03:55.490 --> 03:57.040
How could you change your mind because of a little favor?

03:57.060 --> 03:58.830
Besides, I aimed to take advantage of you.

03:58.850 --> 04:00.400
You're not that kind of person.

04:01.340 --> 04:02.060
How did you know

04:02.060 --> 04:03.730
I'm not that kind of person?

04:03.980 --> 04:05.370
I'm sure about it

04:05.780 --> 04:07.690
because we're the same kind of person.

04:08.570 --> 04:13.250
We're pragmatic, cruel and heartless.

04:14.140 --> 04:17.410
Well said.

04:18.140 --> 04:20.130
We're the same kind of person.

04:20.770 --> 04:22.810
The same kind.

04:24.090 --> 04:25.050
So, you have no reason

04:25.050 --> 04:26.760
to tell me the top secret.

04:29.540 --> 04:31.720
Were you brought up in Danzhou?

04:31.770 --> 04:32.520
Yes.

04:32.540 --> 04:35.160
So, it's not been a long time since you went to the capital city.

04:35.330 --> 04:36.310
That's right.

04:36.330 --> 04:37.740
Were you promoted to be Director-General

04:37.740 --> 04:39.440
of the Investigator's Office in a short time?

04:39.460 --> 04:40.720
Exactly.

04:41.260 --> 04:42.600
Who's your father?

04:43.820 --> 04:45.720
He's called Fan Jian.

04:47.260 --> 04:49.440
Fan Jian.

04:49.820 --> 04:50.740
What does he do?

04:50.740 --> 04:52.320
He serves as Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue.

04:53.140 --> 04:54.480
I remember.

04:55.090 --> 04:57.640
Chen Pingping and he know each other well.

04:57.740 --> 04:58.960
So what?

04:58.980 --> 05:00.490
Now that Fan Jian has been staying in the capital city,

05:00.490 --> 05:02.880
why were you left in Danzhou?

05:03.370 --> 05:05.010
Is it related to you?

05:09.300 --> 05:11.040
Because I'm a bastard.

05:11.300 --> 05:12.720
Who is your mother?

05:13.580 --> 05:15.970
She's dead when I was born.

05:16.610 --> 05:19.290
So you've never seen her.

05:19.820 --> 05:21.530
What on earth do you want to say?

05:21.610 --> 05:23.290
Do you know

05:24.020 --> 05:26.570
your mother was murdered?

05:27.300 --> 05:29.370
Of course I do.

05:29.460 --> 05:32.320
Fan Jian is not your biological father.

05:32.740 --> 05:33.820
Your real father

05:33.820 --> 05:35.570
died long ago.

05:36.740 --> 05:38.090
What?

05:38.420 --> 05:39.850
Kid,

05:39.980 --> 05:42.320
my son is your father.

05:43.740 --> 05:45.690
You're my grandson.

05:48.050 --> 05:49.850
What the heck?

05:53.820 --> 05:56.850
I might be the last of my family line.

05:57.490 --> 05:59.210
You can say that

05:59.210 --> 06:00.750
I'm dying sonless.

06:00.770 --> 06:02.880
What did Shen Zhong do to you?

06:04.140 --> 06:05.530
I know.

06:06.770 --> 06:10.720
You may have doubts more or less.

06:10.930 --> 06:12.050
Come on.

06:12.050 --> 06:14.200
It's sheer nonsense.

06:18.930 --> 06:20.870
Xiao En's grandson?

06:20.890 --> 06:23.130
Chen Pingping, are you muddleheaded?

06:23.170 --> 06:25.250
When Xiao En was caught,

06:25.300 --> 06:26.460
both his son and his daughter-in-law

06:26.460 --> 06:27.540
died on the spot.

06:27.540 --> 06:29.090
How could he have a grandson?

06:29.090 --> 06:30.680
Before getting married,

06:30.700 --> 06:31.700
Xiao En's son

06:31.700 --> 06:33.020
stayed with another woman.

06:33.020 --> 06:33.770
Who was she?

06:33.770 --> 06:35.240
She was a prostitute.

06:35.260 --> 06:37.070
Xiao En's son bought back her freedom

06:37.090 --> 06:39.680
and hid her in a private house. Then she got pregnant.

06:39.700 --> 06:42.050
When Xiao En found it out,

06:42.050 --> 06:44.150
he ordered his son to break up with her

06:44.170 --> 06:47.190
because he was strict with his son.

06:47.210 --> 06:47.890
Then he asked his son

06:47.890 --> 06:49.680
to marry a girl

06:49.700 --> 06:51.240
from a family of equal status.

06:51.260 --> 06:52.930
By rights, such a woman

06:52.930 --> 06:55.090
should be killed to avoid trouble later on.

06:55.090 --> 06:56.330
But she was pregnant, anyway.

06:56.330 --> 06:58.310
So I hid her somewhere,

06:58.330 --> 07:01.600
I wanted to decide whether to kill her or not

07:02.170 --> 07:04.480
after she gave birth.

07:06.020 --> 07:07.850
She's your mother.

07:10.490 --> 07:12.720
She was sold into a brothel when she was very young

07:12.740 --> 07:14.350
and she didn't know her real name.

07:14.370 --> 07:16.810
When she was in the whorehouse,

07:18.890 --> 07:20.410
she was called Yuxiang.

07:21.330 --> 07:23.570
It became her name.

07:23.700 --> 07:25.150
Yuxiang? Come on.

07:25.170 --> 07:27.690
What the heck are you talking about?

07:27.820 --> 07:30.010
Since I was arrested,

07:30.170 --> 07:32.300
I'd been cruelly tortured.

07:32.300 --> 07:34.520
The only thing that made me want to live

07:34.540 --> 07:36.640
is that kid.

07:37.050 --> 07:38.090
But in the end,

07:38.090 --> 07:40.640
Chen Pingping found it out.

07:40.820 --> 07:42.150
Didn't they kill him?

07:42.170 --> 07:43.140
If you die,

07:43.140 --> 07:43.930
I'd find no point

07:43.930 --> 07:45.690
in living anymore.

07:46.300 --> 07:47.720
During that period,

07:48.170 --> 07:48.860
he kept

07:48.860 --> 07:51.130
telling me something about you

07:51.770 --> 07:53.850
to sound me out and threaten me.

07:54.370 --> 07:56.310
But you said nothing.

07:56.330 --> 07:59.040
If I had, both of us would've died.

07:59.370 --> 08:01.040
Only by keeping silent

08:01.210 --> 08:03.090
would you be safe.

08:07.170 --> 08:08.460
At that time,

08:08.460 --> 08:10.120
I wanted to push Xiao En

08:10.140 --> 08:11.540
to tell us the secret

08:11.540 --> 08:14.090
by threatening to kill that kid.

08:14.140 --> 08:15.280
And then?

08:15.300 --> 08:18.320
What tortures a person most is not threats,

08:18.930 --> 08:20.570
but hope.

08:20.700 --> 08:21.930
His Majesty is far-sighted.

08:21.930 --> 08:24.350
No one else can match him.

08:24.370 --> 08:25.880
It's true that

08:26.020 --> 08:27.640
Xiao En wouldn't give in

08:27.740 --> 08:30.870
to threats.

08:30.890 --> 08:32.320
Finally,

08:32.340 --> 08:34.020
as His Majesty suggested,

08:34.020 --> 08:35.290
I told Xiao En I'd make the kid

08:35.290 --> 08:37.330
become one of Nanqing people

08:37.580 --> 08:38.850
and a solider

08:38.850 --> 08:41.580
that hates Beiqi.

08:41.580 --> 08:42.850
I said I'd let the kid

08:42.850 --> 08:44.290
ruin all his hopes

08:44.290 --> 08:47.480
when the kid grows up.

08:47.930 --> 08:49.690
That's malicious.

08:50.530 --> 08:52.890
It's your style.

08:52.930 --> 08:55.480
That's why he believed.

08:56.610 --> 08:59.210
Over the years,

08:59.490 --> 09:00.260
I told him

09:00.260 --> 09:01.370
all little things

09:01.370 --> 09:02.590
about the kid.

09:02.610 --> 09:04.250
Did you tell him

09:04.580 --> 09:06.690
the kid was brought up in Danzhou?

09:07.260 --> 09:08.680
No, I didn't.

09:08.700 --> 09:10.960
He didn't say where you were living,

09:11.260 --> 09:12.690
but he didn't know

09:12.900 --> 09:14.880
I'm familiar with

09:14.900 --> 09:15.930
many cities of Nanqing

09:15.930 --> 09:17.770
to better fight against them.

09:18.530 --> 09:19.530
So,

09:19.530 --> 09:21.370
according to all the details

09:21.370 --> 09:22.610
and the layout of streets

09:22.610 --> 09:24.800
he revealed by accident,

09:24.820 --> 09:27.730
I'm sure you were in Danzhou.

09:27.730 --> 09:28.700
You guessed?

09:28.700 --> 09:32.520
I put all the fragmented information together

09:32.580 --> 09:34.210
and then found the answer.

09:34.490 --> 09:36.370
I couldn't get it wrong.

09:39.370 --> 09:43.210
Xiao En is suspicious and confident by nature.

09:43.370 --> 09:45.660
If I told him it's Danzhou,

09:45.660 --> 09:47.390
he couldn't believe it.

09:47.410 --> 09:50.290
I have to let him guess the answer.

09:50.290 --> 09:52.000
Then he'd have no doubts.

09:52.020 --> 09:53.830
What if he failed to guess it?

09:53.850 --> 09:55.770
He's smart.

09:55.850 --> 09:59.390
A smart person

09:59.410 --> 10:02.400
considers himself always right.

10:05.370 --> 10:06.900
I guessed you were in Danzhou,

10:06.900 --> 10:10.200
but I'd never showed any signs.

10:10.220 --> 10:11.470
Danzhou is a big place.

10:11.490 --> 10:12.640
Why is it me?

10:12.660 --> 10:14.240
You're at the right age.

10:14.260 --> 10:16.120
There are lots of guys at my age.

10:16.140 --> 10:18.680
It's you that took me back to Beiqi.

10:18.700 --> 10:19.960
So what?

10:20.100 --> 10:21.100
If Chen Pingping

10:21.100 --> 10:22.880
wanted to advance your career,

10:22.900 --> 10:25.010
he couldn't have withdrawn black knights.

10:25.290 --> 10:26.730
The Investigator's Office is powerful.

10:26.730 --> 10:27.700
They must've guessed

10:27.700 --> 10:28.950
Hu'er would come to save me.

10:28.970 --> 10:30.610
He withdrew black knights

10:30.610 --> 10:32.560
to let you deal with that all alone

10:32.580 --> 10:34.350
just because

10:34.370 --> 10:37.010
he wanted to see me kill you.

10:41.140 --> 10:43.640
He is Fan Xian, Director-General of the Investigator's Office.

10:43.660 --> 10:44.680
He'll escort you.

10:44.700 --> 10:46.330
Nice to see you, Senior Xiao.

10:46.370 --> 10:47.440
Are you going to escort me?

10:47.460 --> 10:48.260
Yup!

10:48.260 --> 10:49.770
Who are these people to you?

10:50.170 --> 10:51.640
Master Fei is my teacher.

10:51.660 --> 10:53.030
The Head is my senior friend.

10:53.050 --> 10:54.920
They all treat me like families.

10:55.220 --> 10:56.960
Take a good look at this kid.

10:57.660 --> 10:59.400
This will be your last chance.

11:01.220 --> 11:02.830
It doesn't make sense.

11:02.850 --> 11:04.150
Let me guess.

11:04.170 --> 11:05.050
They asked you to kill me

11:05.050 --> 11:07.890
on the way here, right?

11:12.580 --> 11:13.910
Don't you think they're contradictory?

11:13.930 --> 11:14.730
They wanted you to kill me

11:14.730 --> 11:16.840
but they didn't care about your safety.

11:17.020 --> 11:18.760
So, who on earth did he want to kill?

11:18.780 --> 11:19.820
Either.

11:19.820 --> 11:20.820
You kill me

11:20.820 --> 11:23.370
or I kill you.

11:23.460 --> 11:25.150
He'd be glad to see either of us die.

11:25.170 --> 11:26.100
If I kill you,

11:26.100 --> 11:27.890
he'll tell me the truth

11:28.220 --> 11:29.290
and let me realize

11:29.290 --> 11:31.320
I've killed my only grandson.

11:31.340 --> 11:32.600
There is nothing

11:33.780 --> 11:37.280
crueler than that.

11:37.930 --> 11:39.690
It's just a guess.

11:39.780 --> 11:41.000
But it makes sense.

11:41.020 --> 11:41.780
In this case,

11:41.780 --> 11:44.040
everything makes sense.

11:45.410 --> 11:46.890
Over the years,

11:47.100 --> 11:49.580
they left you alone in Danzhou, showing no interest at all.

11:49.580 --> 11:51.170
But suddenly, you were transferred to the capital city

11:51.170 --> 11:52.720
and promoted quickly.

11:53.700 --> 11:55.460
They just wanted to create an opportunity

11:55.460 --> 11:57.120
so that we hurt each other.

11:57.140 --> 11:58.330
Besides,

11:58.370 --> 12:00.600
why didn't they disable me before I left

12:00.900 --> 12:02.840
so that I can't use my martial arts?

12:05.050 --> 12:08.450
Because they want to see me kill you

12:09.170 --> 12:10.840
and regret it.

12:11.290 --> 12:13.000
Do you have any concrete evidence?

12:13.020 --> 12:14.590
Such as a jade pendant or a birthmark

12:14.610 --> 12:15.920
that can prove my identity.

12:18.340 --> 12:19.600
No.

12:20.850 --> 12:22.290
Why didn't you prepare

12:22.290 --> 12:23.930
some concrete evidence?

12:23.930 --> 12:25.440
Keep your voice down.

12:25.460 --> 12:27.450
You scared the fish away.

12:28.930 --> 12:29.970
It's His Majesty's idea.

12:29.970 --> 12:31.900
What's most amazing about it

12:31.900 --> 12:34.370
is that no concrete evidence is prepared.

12:34.370 --> 12:36.820
The more concrete evidence there is, the more suspicious he'd be.

12:36.820 --> 12:38.660
The more contradictions I created,

12:38.660 --> 12:41.720
the more convinced he'd be of Fan Xian's identity.

12:46.340 --> 12:49.130
What a good plan!

12:50.050 --> 12:52.810
A battlefield of human feelings

12:54.050 --> 12:57.250
is most breathtaking.

12:57.820 --> 13:00.280
But this is how things are.

13:00.340 --> 13:01.850
You're intelligent.

13:01.850 --> 13:03.260
You must understand

13:03.260 --> 13:04.920
what I said is true.

13:05.610 --> 13:07.460
The only thing Chen Pingping got wrong

13:07.460 --> 13:08.660
is that he didn't expect

13:08.660 --> 13:09.700
I've guessed

13:09.700 --> 13:11.320
you were in Danzhou.

13:11.340 --> 13:12.820
In the end, the only loophole

13:12.820 --> 13:14.270
made me

13:14.290 --> 13:16.250
find out the truth

13:16.580 --> 13:19.880
and stop us from fighting against each other.

13:19.900 --> 13:21.030
That's why

13:21.050 --> 13:22.510
you stopped Shangshan Hu killing me at that time?

13:22.530 --> 13:24.040
Yes.

13:24.140 --> 13:25.410
But you said nothing later

13:25.410 --> 13:27.250
on the way.

13:27.340 --> 13:30.480
Would you believe it if I had told you suddenly?

13:31.220 --> 13:33.040
But you're telling me about it now.

13:33.220 --> 13:34.460
Because I'm dying.

13:34.460 --> 13:37.480
No matter if you believe it or not,

13:38.340 --> 13:41.080
I have to tell you the truth.

13:43.260 --> 13:44.710
There is something weird.

13:44.730 --> 13:46.580
Why did Chen Pingping do so much

13:46.580 --> 13:48.340
to torture you?

13:48.340 --> 13:50.210
Because it was me

13:50.930 --> 13:52.830
that broke his legs that year.

13:52.850 --> 13:54.920
He hates me like poison.

13:55.340 --> 13:57.100
When a person like Chen Pingping

13:57.100 --> 13:59.650
holds a grudge against someone,

14:00.220 --> 14:03.270
he wouldn't let it go

14:03.290 --> 14:05.160
even if 10 or 100 years have passed.

14:06.410 --> 14:10.280
He'd take revenge no matter how long he has to wait.

14:13.020 --> 14:14.610
Xiao En knows me well.

14:14.610 --> 14:18.130
He knows that once I hate someone,

14:18.660 --> 14:20.340
I'd never forget about it.

14:20.340 --> 14:23.890
But there is one thing he got wrong.

14:24.490 --> 14:26.770
I don't hate him.

14:27.220 --> 14:28.610
I caught him and killed his family,

14:28.610 --> 14:30.100
so he broke my legs.

14:30.100 --> 14:31.690
It's fair.

14:32.660 --> 14:34.050
I have no reason to hate him.

14:34.050 --> 14:36.030
If I didn't mishear it,

14:36.050 --> 14:37.830
you began to make up lies

14:37.850 --> 14:39.580
soon after you caught him.

14:39.580 --> 14:40.510
Yes.

14:40.530 --> 14:42.920
You've never stopped doing that over the years.

14:43.290 --> 14:47.240
They became more convincing as time went by.

14:47.260 --> 14:48.950
You used Fan Xian as a pawn

14:48.970 --> 14:51.650
while he was just a baby.

14:52.290 --> 14:54.410
You know, it's not easy

14:54.410 --> 14:55.660
to deceive a smart person.

14:55.660 --> 14:57.030
It takes a long time.

14:57.050 --> 14:59.640
Have you ever thought about the risks?

14:59.660 --> 15:01.250
What if black knight were withdrawn

15:01.610 --> 15:03.050
and Xiao En was not that smart?

15:03.050 --> 15:04.140
What if he didn't get fooled

15:04.140 --> 15:06.290
and really killed Fan Xian?

15:06.290 --> 15:07.840
What would you do?

15:08.490 --> 15:09.850
Xiao En wouldn't believe it

15:09.850 --> 15:11.170
unless black knights were withdrawn.

15:11.170 --> 15:12.760
So, you're

15:12.780 --> 15:15.950
risking Fan Xian's life?

15:15.970 --> 15:18.280
Are you done yet?

15:25.170 --> 15:29.390
He's Ye Qingmei's son.

15:29.410 --> 15:31.250
Do you know

15:31.460 --> 15:33.020
what on earth

15:33.020 --> 15:34.960
Xiao En's secret is about?

15:37.220 --> 15:38.830
The secret I mentioned

15:38.850 --> 15:40.200
is about a place

15:40.220 --> 15:42.010
and a person.

15:42.220 --> 15:44.650
Have you heard of the divine temple?

15:45.460 --> 15:48.330
Any temple for worshipping is a divine temple.

15:49.050 --> 15:51.760
When heaven was separated from earth, giant monsters ran wild.

15:51.780 --> 15:54.080
Master from the divine temple came
to earth with dignity and virtue,

15:54.100 --> 15:55.370
teaching mankind characters and etiquette

15:55.370 --> 15:57.220
and helping mankind cut mountains and make seas,

15:57.220 --> 15:59.240
thus laying foundation for the human race.

15:59.260 --> 16:01.210
How could you not know that?

16:01.850 --> 16:03.720
The divine temple?

16:05.460 --> 16:06.680
Isn't it imaginary

16:06.700 --> 16:08.200
and nobody has ever been there?

16:08.220 --> 16:09.950
I saw it.

16:09.970 --> 16:11.440
Where?

16:11.460 --> 16:13.680
In the north. The farthest north.

16:13.700 --> 16:15.130
The north?

16:16.820 --> 16:19.030
Do you know I have an elder brother?

16:19.050 --> 16:20.570
Zhuang Mohan?

16:21.460 --> 16:23.400
It turns out you knew it.

16:23.700 --> 16:25.350
He's my brother,

16:25.370 --> 16:26.610
so he's your granduncle

16:26.610 --> 16:29.690
or great-uncle.

16:31.580 --> 16:32.710
He spit blood because of me

16:32.730 --> 16:34.480
in the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest.

16:35.970 --> 16:37.450
I've heard of it.

16:37.850 --> 16:39.950
We're a family. It doesn't matter.

16:39.970 --> 16:41.720
Rising to fame at a young age,

16:42.290 --> 16:43.900
he's a famous literator.

16:43.900 --> 16:45.100
I didn't accomplish incredible things at that time.

16:45.100 --> 16:49.320
I served as Head of Embroidered Uniform Guards,

16:49.340 --> 16:51.270
but many people thought

16:51.290 --> 16:52.680
I profited from association with him.

16:52.700 --> 16:54.520
I was not convinced,

16:55.020 --> 16:57.130
so I took my mother's surname.

16:57.900 --> 17:00.010
That is, your great grandma's surname.

17:00.050 --> 17:01.780
Enough. Stop talking about the relatives.

17:01.780 --> 17:02.410
I've got so many elders

17:02.410 --> 17:03.840
in a short time.

17:05.130 --> 17:07.100
Fine. Let's get to the point.

17:07.100 --> 17:08.580
I got a new surname

17:08.580 --> 17:10.560
and decided to do something big.

17:11.130 --> 17:12.440
At that time,

17:12.460 --> 17:14.460
the late emperor focused on

17:14.460 --> 17:16.100
immortality.

17:16.100 --> 17:18.380
He spent lots of time and money on it

17:18.380 --> 17:20.150
and finally got some clues

17:20.170 --> 17:21.930
which indicated that

17:22.460 --> 17:24.930
the divine temple is in the north.

17:26.250 --> 17:29.960
The late emperor sent a group of over 1,000 people

17:29.980 --> 17:31.890
=Young Xiao En=
to the north

17:31.930 --> 17:34.080
for the divine temple.

17:34.100 --> 17:37.300
It was me and Ku He that led the group.

17:37.320 --> 17:38.480
=Young Ku He=

17:38.500 --> 17:39.800
Ku He?

17:39.820 --> 17:41.510
Even a Great Master was sent there.

17:41.530 --> 17:42.800
At that time,

17:42.820 --> 17:44.870
Ku He wasn't a Great Master yet.

17:44.890 --> 17:46.440
The late emperor let him do it

17:46.460 --> 17:48.620
because he's keen on the harmony between nature and mankind,

17:48.620 --> 17:51.320
and yearned to go to the divine temple.

17:51.340 --> 17:51.930
Besides,

17:51.930 --> 17:54.580
he's a member of the royal family, anyway.

17:54.580 --> 17:56.650
So, he could serve as a supervisor.

17:57.500 --> 17:59.650
Is Ku He a member of the royal family?

18:00.890 --> 18:03.410
Speaking of that,

18:03.930 --> 18:06.410
the late emperor is his elder brother.

18:07.010 --> 18:08.620
No wonder the current little emperor

18:08.620 --> 18:09.500
and the Empress Dowager

18:09.500 --> 18:11.410
trust him so much.

18:13.130 --> 18:14.440
In this case,

18:14.460 --> 18:16.530
Ku He is also qualified for the throne.

18:16.650 --> 18:17.700
Well, Ku He

18:17.700 --> 18:20.150
is hypocritical,

18:20.170 --> 18:22.580
but he's indifferent to politics.

18:22.580 --> 18:24.360
He's not interested

18:24.380 --> 18:26.440
in the throne.

18:27.050 --> 18:28.220
Please go ahead.

18:28.220 --> 18:29.530
Did you keep going north

18:29.530 --> 18:30.750
and then find the divine temple?

18:30.770 --> 18:32.930
It wasn't that easy.

18:34.290 --> 18:36.050
We kept going north

18:36.100 --> 18:38.600
and went by Beilao Pass,

18:39.010 --> 18:41.930
arriving somewhere no one has ever been.

18:42.820 --> 18:46.680
The wild north snowed all year round.

18:47.580 --> 18:49.390
What we saw every day and night

18:49.410 --> 18:52.130
was snow-covered landscape.

18:53.820 --> 18:57.840
Gradually, some people went blind

18:59.220 --> 19:01.440
and some suffered from serious diseases.

19:02.820 --> 19:05.560
Fewer and fewer people were left.

19:07.650 --> 19:11.030
Accidents frequently happened on the dangerous snow land.

19:11.050 --> 19:13.380
More and more of us fell behind,

19:13.380 --> 19:15.100
ran away or just died.

19:15.100 --> 19:18.440
Only a few hundred people left.

19:18.500 --> 19:20.080
Still later,

19:20.100 --> 19:22.770
we lost supplies and provisions.

19:22.770 --> 19:24.840
Even horses were eaten.

19:25.770 --> 19:28.390
At that time, we couldn't turn back.

19:28.410 --> 19:29.410
We knew

19:29.410 --> 19:31.410
it was impossible to go back.

19:31.580 --> 19:35.530
Do you know what it feels like to be truly hungry?

19:37.770 --> 19:40.910
No animals. No plants.

19:40.930 --> 19:42.720
Everywhere was covered with snow.

19:43.650 --> 19:45.720
You'd go crazy because of hunger.

19:46.700 --> 19:50.030
Something was aroused deep in your heart

19:50.050 --> 19:51.680
and it swallowed all your humanity,

19:51.700 --> 19:53.770
etiquette and morality

19:53.770 --> 19:55.530
little by little.

19:55.530 --> 19:56.930
Then,

19:58.130 --> 20:01.050
you became a beast.

20:42.410 --> 20:44.440
Have you ever been in despair?

20:47.100 --> 20:49.080
Good.

20:49.980 --> 20:51.130
I hope you'd never

20:51.130 --> 20:53.800
have a chance to experience that.

20:53.820 --> 20:56.130
Finally, only Ku He and I

20:56.130 --> 20:57.460
survived.

20:57.460 --> 20:59.050
Actually, our stories

20:59.130 --> 21:01.200
almost had a different ending.

21:01.500 --> 21:02.990
Killing each other.

21:03.010 --> 21:04.770
But at that time,

21:06.650 --> 21:09.370
we found Heaven was angry.

21:10.580 --> 21:11.740
Maybe the divine temple was enraged

21:11.740 --> 21:13.580
after knowing that we common people

21:13.580 --> 21:14.860
tried to find it.

21:14.860 --> 21:16.390
Maybe

21:16.410 --> 21:17.460
it was a punishment

21:17.460 --> 21:19.250
for what we had done.

21:23.740 --> 21:27.410
The farther north we went, the longer the night was.

21:27.530 --> 21:29.680
Then one day,

21:29.770 --> 21:31.010
endless darkness

21:31.010 --> 21:33.960
arrived.

21:47.770 --> 21:49.110
It's called polar night.

21:49.130 --> 21:50.680
Why?

21:51.130 --> 21:52.130
Who named it?

21:52.130 --> 21:53.680
I'm just saying.

21:53.700 --> 21:54.380
Go on.

21:54.380 --> 21:56.600
What happened when the polar night appeared?

21:57.010 --> 21:59.380
Ku He prayed to Heaven,

21:59.380 --> 22:00.800
so did I.

22:00.820 --> 22:02.100
Later, we found green alga

22:02.100 --> 22:03.910
under the snow.

22:03.930 --> 22:05.250
It's bitter,

22:05.290 --> 22:07.870
but it's non-poisonous.

22:07.890 --> 22:09.010
We suffered all kinds of torments

22:09.010 --> 22:10.270
in the darkness every day.

22:10.290 --> 22:11.990
We didn't know how long had passed,

22:12.010 --> 22:14.170
but we knew our lives would come to an end.

22:14.340 --> 22:15.010
Just when we thought

22:15.010 --> 22:16.720
we were dying,

22:16.740 --> 22:18.010
the day

22:19.170 --> 22:20.890
finally broke.

22:31.530 --> 22:35.170
It was hope that Heaven gave us.

22:36.380 --> 22:37.820
It made us hang in there

22:37.820 --> 22:39.320
and survive.

22:41.170 --> 22:43.010
You had lots of luck.

22:43.340 --> 22:44.410
You even survived the polar night

22:44.410 --> 22:45.840
that usually lasts several months.

22:46.220 --> 22:47.800
Then,

22:48.170 --> 22:50.200
we found the divine temple.

22:51.010 --> 22:52.560
Where is it?

22:53.340 --> 22:55.600
I don't know.

22:55.620 --> 22:57.480
Didn't you find it?

22:58.380 --> 23:00.530
It wasn't there at the beginning,

23:00.700 --> 23:02.990
but it appeared suddenly.

23:03.010 --> 23:04.630
I still don't understand

23:04.650 --> 23:06.600
how it appeared.

23:07.930 --> 23:09.410
I also don't know

23:10.170 --> 23:12.840
what on earth the divine temple is.

23:20.340 --> 23:22.770
Grey walls and a brown gate?

23:23.380 --> 23:25.650
The temple in Beiqi

23:25.650 --> 23:26.860
is the same color.

23:26.860 --> 23:30.050
But the one in Nanqing is different.

23:30.250 --> 23:31.680
Do you mean

23:32.010 --> 23:33.360
Nanqing got it wrong as for colors

23:33.380 --> 23:35.390
and Beiqi is correct?

23:35.410 --> 23:36.560
No.

23:36.580 --> 23:38.600
He said what we saw

23:38.930 --> 23:42.650
was what we thought it was.

23:43.100 --> 23:45.870
He? Do you mean Ku He?

23:45.890 --> 23:47.800
No.

23:47.820 --> 23:48.700
You just said

23:48.700 --> 23:50.460
Ku He and you were the only survivors.

23:50.460 --> 23:51.700
So, who is he?

23:51.700 --> 23:54.680
No hurry. Let me explain.

23:54.770 --> 23:56.080
Okay. Go ahead.

23:56.100 --> 23:57.010
You found the divine temple.

23:57.010 --> 23:58.510
What did you see after you went in?

23:58.530 --> 23:59.910
Went in?

23:59.930 --> 24:01.630
We failed to go in.

24:01.650 --> 24:02.820
But you just said

24:02.820 --> 24:04.030
there was a brown gate.

24:04.050 --> 24:05.100
There was a gate,

24:05.100 --> 24:06.720
but

24:07.170 --> 24:08.440
it's untouchable.

24:08.890 --> 24:10.890
What do you mean by "untouchable"?

25:18.770 --> 25:21.650
Do you mean the gate drew back automatically?

25:21.700 --> 25:23.560
Not exactly.

25:23.580 --> 25:25.770
Let me put it this way.

25:26.820 --> 25:31.250
It's like the gate was there,

25:31.820 --> 25:32.650
but it moved to another place

25:32.650 --> 25:33.820
automatically

25:33.820 --> 25:35.290
when I reached out my hand.

25:35.290 --> 25:37.890
No matter how hard I forged ahead,

25:38.410 --> 25:40.870
it always kept a short distance from me.

25:40.890 --> 25:41.990
Only a very short distance,

25:42.010 --> 25:44.440
but it's like a whole world.

25:44.460 --> 25:46.560
I could never touch it.

25:53.250 --> 25:55.170
Spatial warping?

25:55.380 --> 25:56.680
Ku He said

25:56.700 --> 25:58.460
it was because I was not sincere enough.

25:58.460 --> 26:00.960
Then he prayed sincerely

26:00.980 --> 26:04.080
before he reached out his hand.

26:07.580 --> 26:09.080
Did it work?

26:10.290 --> 26:11.390
He couldn't touch it either?

26:11.410 --> 26:12.930
That's right,

26:13.170 --> 26:15.320
but it was a different case

26:15.340 --> 26:17.480
for him.

26:31.700 --> 26:33.440
A hologram?

26:34.930 --> 26:36.230
What?

26:36.250 --> 26:38.080
A kind of optical and shadow illusion.

26:38.100 --> 26:39.100
It looks real,

26:39.100 --> 26:40.480
but it doesn't exist.

26:41.620 --> 26:43.010
No.

26:44.930 --> 26:46.840
It was not an illusion.

26:48.500 --> 26:50.440
It was not an illusion.

26:51.050 --> 26:53.250
How could it be like this?

26:54.500 --> 26:56.680
We tried a lot of ways,

26:56.700 --> 27:00.170
but we just couldn't touch the gate.

27:00.380 --> 27:02.560
When I tried, it was untouchable.

27:02.580 --> 27:06.230
When he tried, the divine temple disappeared.

27:06.250 --> 27:07.600
How about climbing walls?

27:09.890 --> 27:10.860
It was the same case.

27:10.860 --> 27:13.080
The walls were untouchable too.

27:13.130 --> 27:14.480
Ku He said

27:14.500 --> 27:17.010
it was our destiny.

27:19.130 --> 27:22.010
And then? Did you go back?

27:22.530 --> 27:24.530
What's the point of keeping it a secret?

27:26.130 --> 27:28.080
Then the gate opened.

27:29.250 --> 27:31.080
Wasn't it untouchable?

27:31.100 --> 27:32.650
Yes, it was.

27:32.890 --> 27:34.010
How did you push it open?

27:34.010 --> 27:36.170
It was opened from the inside.

27:36.980 --> 27:38.560
Someone opened it from the inside?

27:38.580 --> 27:40.560
That's why I said

27:40.580 --> 27:43.130
my secret is about a place

27:43.650 --> 27:45.370
and a person.

27:45.820 --> 27:47.620
The place is the divine temple.

27:47.620 --> 27:49.200
And the person

27:50.410 --> 27:53.130
is the fairy from the temple.

27:54.010 --> 27:55.560
A woman.

27:55.860 --> 27:58.460
Later, she came to the human world.

27:58.460 --> 28:00.620
Her name is

28:00.620 --> 28:02.650
Ye Qingmei.

28:06.410 --> 28:08.680
I wonder if you've heard of it.

28:10.010 --> 28:11.250
I…

28:12.770 --> 28:14.370
Her name is Ye Qingmei.

28:15.130 --> 28:16.720
Ye Qingmei?

28:17.410 --> 28:19.840
It means "looking down upon all men".

28:24.410 --> 28:27.440
She was bound to no rules of the world.

28:27.890 --> 28:29.840
She could always

28:29.860 --> 28:32.050
make unexpected moves.

28:32.050 --> 28:34.960
Do you know who once lived in this yard?

28:35.410 --> 28:36.320
I've no idea.

28:36.340 --> 28:38.800
It was an old friend of mine.

28:39.130 --> 28:40.750
At that time, she just stood there.

28:40.770 --> 28:42.080
I asked her

28:42.930 --> 28:44.530
what flowers she wanted to plant

28:44.530 --> 28:46.370
when the Investigator's Office was just set up.

28:46.410 --> 28:48.010
I'd find them no matter how precious they are

28:48.460 --> 28:50.580
as long as she told me.

28:50.580 --> 28:51.700
Your mother actually was

28:51.700 --> 28:53.410
unparalleled in the world.

28:53.410 --> 28:55.860
What's so magical about my mom?

28:55.860 --> 28:57.370
She's the guider

28:57.410 --> 28:58.820
and the betrayer.

28:58.820 --> 29:00.560
She's like Nuwa who repaired the heaven.

29:00.580 --> 29:01.910
She's the cause of every phenomenon on earth.

29:01.930 --> 29:03.720
She's the end of finality.

29:06.170 --> 29:08.250
Hi, my son.

29:08.380 --> 29:10.150
You didn't misread it.

29:10.170 --> 29:13.050
This letter is for you.

29:15.460 --> 29:17.370
Of course I've heard of it.

29:17.530 --> 29:18.960
What's more,

29:18.980 --> 29:21.010
she's my mom.

29:21.340 --> 29:24.080
That was the first time I met her.

30:24.650 --> 30:27.130
=Ye Qingmei=
Hi people, nice to meet you.

30:28.290 --> 30:30.290
It's a nice day.

30:35.010 --> 30:37.050
Anything wrong?

30:37.290 --> 30:38.250
I've got changed

30:38.250 --> 30:39.290
and dressed up

30:39.290 --> 30:41.080
as people in this era do.

30:42.500 --> 30:44.290
Can you tell me

30:44.620 --> 30:46.560
if you're stupid?

30:48.770 --> 30:50.270
She was straightforward.

30:50.290 --> 30:51.620
It also took us some time

30:51.620 --> 30:52.820
to respond.

30:52.820 --> 30:53.700
Seeing a fairy come out of

30:53.700 --> 30:56.530
the divine temple,

30:56.890 --> 30:59.840
Ku He knelt and kowtowed at once.

31:01.010 --> 31:02.840
But I hesitated.

31:02.860 --> 31:04.770
What's the point of kneeling?

31:06.410 --> 31:07.410
That's how he became

31:07.410 --> 31:08.960
a Grand Master.

31:08.980 --> 31:10.480
It's my mom…

31:13.460 --> 31:15.250
Are the two things related?

31:15.460 --> 31:16.600
May I have your name?

31:16.620 --> 31:17.910
We don't know each other.

31:17.930 --> 31:19.890
Why are you kowtowing to me?

31:27.290 --> 31:28.650
It's dangerous here.

31:28.650 --> 31:30.440
Let's get out of here.

31:31.170 --> 31:32.680
Come on.

31:33.770 --> 31:34.990
If you keep doing it,

31:35.010 --> 31:36.960
you'd suffer from cerebral concussion.

31:47.410 --> 31:50.130
I think your physique is suitable for it.

31:50.130 --> 31:51.440
Hold on.

31:59.290 --> 32:00.720
Here you are.

32:02.500 --> 32:03.170
I've made it

32:03.170 --> 32:04.100
written in a way

32:04.100 --> 32:05.230
you're used to.

32:05.250 --> 32:06.960
Just read and follow it.

32:07.220 --> 32:08.510
Secret techniques?

32:08.530 --> 32:09.890
In a sense,

32:09.890 --> 32:11.290
it is.

32:12.580 --> 32:14.250
You can read it too.

32:14.380 --> 32:16.840
But he's more suitable.

32:18.530 --> 32:19.960
Alright.

32:20.340 --> 32:21.750
I must go.

32:21.770 --> 32:23.930
Or they'll catch up with me.

33:39.580 --> 33:40.750
Dangerous?

33:40.770 --> 33:42.080
What's dangerous?

33:42.100 --> 33:43.100
She said there was something

33:43.100 --> 33:44.440
that didn't want her to leave.

33:44.460 --> 33:46.380
Someone was stopping it

33:46.380 --> 33:48.320
from pursuing her inside.

33:49.050 --> 33:51.820
So, she asked us to

33:51.820 --> 33:53.740
take her out of the snow land ASAP.

33:53.740 --> 33:55.010
Where did you go?

33:55.460 --> 33:57.600
Did you take her to Beiqi?

33:57.770 --> 33:58.960
Yeah.

33:58.980 --> 34:00.110
How about that book?

34:00.130 --> 34:02.320
I studied it with Ku He.

34:02.340 --> 34:03.290
As she predicted,

34:03.290 --> 34:04.340
Ku He made faster progress than me

34:04.340 --> 34:07.170
no matter how hard I practiced.

34:10.900 --> 34:12.760
Did you go straight back to Beiqi?

34:13.490 --> 34:14.800
No.

34:15.770 --> 34:18.040
She asked us a lot on the way.

34:18.250 --> 34:20.520
When we were about to arrive at Beilao Pass,

34:22.210 --> 34:23.840
she parted with us.

34:23.860 --> 34:26.170
Parted? Why?

34:30.770 --> 34:31.990
I want to play too.

34:32.010 --> 34:33.600
You want to play?

34:34.210 --> 34:35.520
Here you are.

34:44.450 --> 34:45.970
You'd better go back.

34:46.580 --> 34:47.750
How about you?

34:47.770 --> 34:49.180
Something is chasing my friend.

34:49.180 --> 34:50.470
I have to help him.

34:50.490 --> 34:52.600
I'm willing to give a hand.

34:52.620 --> 34:53.490
No way.

34:53.490 --> 34:54.750
Based on your current capacities,

34:54.770 --> 34:56.510
the survival rate is less than 10%.

34:56.530 --> 34:59.040
It means you'll die.

35:04.250 --> 35:05.320
Don't worry.

35:05.340 --> 35:06.270
Just go back.

35:06.290 --> 35:07.840
I'll be fine.

35:09.620 --> 35:11.100
Ku He treated her words

35:11.100 --> 35:13.650
like an imperial edict.

35:13.690 --> 35:14.930
No.

35:15.290 --> 35:17.640
He showed more respect to her words.

35:17.660 --> 35:20.430
So, he listened to her and left.

35:20.450 --> 35:21.710
How about you?

35:21.730 --> 35:23.660
I was interested in that book,

35:23.660 --> 35:25.280
so I followed him.

35:25.620 --> 35:26.360
Besides,

35:26.380 --> 35:29.000
people from the divine temple don't like to be bothered.

35:29.490 --> 35:31.890
I have the wisdom to know myself.

35:31.940 --> 35:33.520
I didn't dare to step in.

35:33.860 --> 35:35.970
That's an interesting story,

35:36.100 --> 35:37.710
but I still don't understand

35:37.730 --> 35:39.280
why you have to keep it a secret.

35:39.580 --> 35:41.560
She asked us to do that.

35:44.820 --> 35:47.320
I hope you can do me a favor.

35:50.690 --> 35:51.880
Please stand up.

35:51.900 --> 35:53.420
It's too much for me.

35:53.420 --> 35:54.650
Got it.

35:56.620 --> 35:57.600
It's just

35:57.620 --> 35:59.320
I hope you can keep it a secret.

35:59.340 --> 36:01.230
Don't tell anyone where the divine temple is

36:01.250 --> 36:02.990
and don't tell anyone you met me there.

36:03.010 --> 36:05.490
Please keep everything about the divine temple

36:05.530 --> 36:06.990
to yourself.

36:07.010 --> 36:07.950
Don't let anyone else know about it.

36:07.970 --> 36:09.280
Got it.

36:09.620 --> 36:10.890
Why?

36:11.050 --> 36:11.730
Do you know

36:11.730 --> 36:13.430
what the divine temple looks like?

36:13.450 --> 36:14.640
I saw it.

36:14.660 --> 36:16.800
It has black walls and grey eaves.

36:17.010 --> 36:18.400
Actually it doesn't.

36:18.420 --> 36:20.730
That's what you think it is.

36:20.770 --> 36:22.050
What you saw

36:22.050 --> 36:24.210
was what you thought it was.

36:24.450 --> 36:25.290
Some people think

36:25.290 --> 36:26.920
the divine temple should be glittering.

36:26.940 --> 36:27.950
So, they'll see

36:27.970 --> 36:30.190
a golden house.

36:30.210 --> 36:32.380
Does the divine temple change

36:32.380 --> 36:33.380
as people wish?

36:33.380 --> 36:34.360
You can say that.

36:34.380 --> 36:35.180
It's true that

36:35.180 --> 36:37.450
it can read what's on people's mind.

36:38.140 --> 36:39.380
In this case,

36:39.380 --> 36:41.640
the divine temple is a living being.

36:41.660 --> 36:42.940
You can also say that.

36:42.940 --> 36:44.370
Is it really a living being?

36:45.250 --> 36:47.040
Very close, but not exactly.

36:47.340 --> 36:49.430
Let me put it this way.

36:49.450 --> 36:50.580
Something bad is imprisoned

36:50.580 --> 36:52.270
under the divine temple.

36:52.290 --> 36:53.860
The more people find it,

36:53.860 --> 36:54.620
the more likely it is

36:54.620 --> 36:55.660
to get out.

36:55.660 --> 36:57.470
Once it runs away,

36:57.490 --> 36:59.410
it'll be the end of the world.

36:59.580 --> 37:01.510
So, for the sake of all living creatures,

37:01.530 --> 37:02.580
I hope

37:02.580 --> 37:04.520
you can keep it a secret.

37:08.620 --> 37:10.120
I'd do that

37:10.140 --> 37:11.950
even if I have to die.

37:11.970 --> 37:13.600
I'll do all I can

37:13.620 --> 37:16.170
to stop anyone else from finding the divine temple.

37:17.010 --> 37:18.750
Thank you.

37:18.770 --> 37:20.800
I'm leaving for my friend.

37:45.100 --> 37:46.360
As for that book,

37:46.380 --> 37:46.970
you can't take it

37:46.970 --> 37:48.670
without sharing with me.

37:48.690 --> 37:49.840
Your Excellency,

37:49.860 --> 37:52.470
please keep everything about the divine temple to yourself.

37:52.490 --> 37:53.290
If I find out

37:53.290 --> 37:54.750
you spill the beans,

37:54.770 --> 37:56.130
I'll kill you.

38:01.770 --> 38:03.600
Since then,

38:04.580 --> 38:07.520
I've never seen Ye Qingmei again.

38:08.290 --> 38:09.180
As expected,

38:09.180 --> 38:11.230
mom came from the divine temple.

38:11.250 --> 38:11.860
Her friend

38:11.860 --> 38:13.290
must be Uncle Wuzhu.

38:13.290 --> 38:15.050
But who was chasing them?

38:15.050 --> 38:17.080
Or what was chasing them?

38:17.100 --> 38:18.140
What secret on earth was it

38:18.140 --> 38:19.890
under the divine temple?

38:20.010 --> 38:21.880
It can change its appearance as people wish.

38:21.900 --> 38:23.410
Is it mind reading?

38:30.770 --> 38:32.240
What's on your mind?

38:33.340 --> 38:34.230
Nothing.

38:34.250 --> 38:35.600
I'm quite shocked.

38:36.380 --> 38:37.360
So, you've been keeping it

38:37.380 --> 38:38.970
to yourself?

38:39.210 --> 38:40.800
I promised.

38:42.180 --> 38:43.470
I seldom broke my promise.

38:43.490 --> 38:45.080
But you told me.

38:45.420 --> 38:47.140
Because I think

38:47.140 --> 38:49.170
Chen Pingping is overenthusiastic

38:49.250 --> 38:50.620
about the divine temple

38:50.620 --> 38:52.210
and Ye Qingmei.

38:52.340 --> 38:54.040
Now that you know the secret,

38:54.690 --> 38:56.970
Chen Pingping wouldn't kill you

38:56.970 --> 39:00.800
and you may even take control of him.

39:02.620 --> 39:03.490
It's also why

39:03.490 --> 39:05.370
Ku He wants to kill you.

39:05.730 --> 39:07.710
After being imprisoned for years,

39:07.730 --> 39:09.690
I was finally set free.

39:09.770 --> 39:12.120
He thinks that I may stage a comeback

39:12.140 --> 39:14.560
by use of the secret.

39:15.140 --> 39:17.240
It's about the divine temple anyway.

39:17.660 --> 39:19.290
All beliefs in the world

39:19.290 --> 39:21.320
are about the holy place.

39:21.660 --> 39:23.210
Will you do that?

39:25.860 --> 39:27.650
Who knows?

39:28.250 --> 39:29.600
What happened later?

39:29.620 --> 39:30.250
When did Ku He

39:30.250 --> 39:31.650
become a Grand Master?

39:32.010 --> 39:33.950
Maybe two or three years later after that.

39:33.970 --> 39:34.820
He left me in dust

39:34.820 --> 39:36.080
before long

39:36.100 --> 39:37.760
just because of the book

39:37.820 --> 39:39.920
he got at the divine temple.

39:39.940 --> 39:40.950
How about Ye Qingmei?

39:40.970 --> 39:42.410
Where did she go?

39:42.450 --> 39:44.530
I heard she traveled around the world,

39:44.530 --> 39:48.240
with a blind servant.

39:49.580 --> 39:51.010
She went to Dongyi Town

39:51.010 --> 39:52.820
and met Si Gujian.

39:52.820 --> 39:54.640
Then she went to Nanqing

39:54.660 --> 39:58.210
and met Ye Liuyun.

39:58.490 --> 40:01.280
She met three of the Four Great Masters.

40:04.970 --> 40:06.560
During the ten years,

40:06.660 --> 40:08.240
she stayed in Nanqing,

40:08.530 --> 40:09.450
establishing firms

40:09.450 --> 40:13.370
and making lots of amazing stuff.

40:13.620 --> 40:17.840
She even became the richest person in the world.

40:17.860 --> 40:19.600
Everyone was shocked,

40:19.620 --> 40:21.650
but I was not surprised at all.

40:21.690 --> 40:23.320
She came from the divine temple.

40:23.490 --> 40:26.370
It's normal no matter how unbelievable

40:26.820 --> 40:28.730
things were.

40:29.290 --> 40:30.560
Yeah.

40:30.770 --> 40:33.840
She was just a legend.

40:34.940 --> 40:37.320
But I didn't expect

40:37.730 --> 40:40.000
such a fairy

40:41.770 --> 40:43.140
would fall in love with a mortal

40:43.140 --> 40:45.920
and finally marry into the royal family of Nanqing.

40:45.940 --> 40:49.140
Nanqing is astonishingly lucky.

40:49.140 --> 40:53.560
It's a pity that Beiqi has no luck.

40:54.050 --> 40:55.410
What did you say?

40:57.770 --> 40:58.930
Do you mean…

40:59.340 --> 41:00.120
What's up?

41:00.140 --> 41:01.050
Do you mean Ye Qingmei

41:01.050 --> 41:02.920
married into the royal family of Nanqing?

41:02.940 --> 41:04.520
Yeah.

41:04.730 --> 41:06.210
Did you get it wrong?

41:08.340 --> 41:09.560
Few guys

41:09.580 --> 41:12.170
know about it in the world.

41:12.340 --> 41:15.840
But I was Head of Embroidered Uniform Guards.

41:16.580 --> 41:18.890
They couldn't hide it from me.

41:19.770 --> 41:21.370
Who did she marry?

41:21.530 --> 41:23.160
He was a prince at that time.

41:23.180 --> 41:24.730
Now,

41:24.900 --> 41:27.650
he's the emperor of Nanqing.

41:28.620 --> 41:30.430
Did she marry Emperor Qing?

41:30.450 --> 41:31.760
Exactly.

41:34.770 --> 41:37.180
They didn't hold a wedding ceremony,

41:37.180 --> 41:39.930
but they were actually a couple.

41:40.210 --> 41:42.450
Ye Qingmei was also pregnant

41:42.450 --> 41:44.170
with his baby.

41:45.010 --> 41:45.690
That's the last thing

41:45.690 --> 41:47.490
I knew about her.

41:47.900 --> 41:49.360
After that,

41:49.380 --> 41:51.800
Chen Pingping traveled thousands of miles

41:51.820 --> 41:54.030
to catch me and take me to Nanqing.

41:54.050 --> 41:55.770
After being imprisoned in the Investigator's Office,

41:55.770 --> 41:58.320
I knew nothing more about her.

41:59.420 --> 42:01.410
I heard she died.

42:02.340 --> 42:03.970
Her kid's father

42:05.620 --> 42:07.970
is Emperor Qing?

42:09.820 --> 42:11.140
That's right.

42:11.140 --> 42:13.990
I think he's at your age.

42:14.010 --> 42:15.290
I'd been imprisoned for so long,

42:15.290 --> 42:17.370
so I don't know too much about the royal family of Nanqing.

42:19.690 --> 42:21.560
I'm not sure

42:22.580 --> 42:24.750
which prince is that kid

42:24.770 --> 42:27.000
or if there is something special about him.

42:27.940 --> 42:30.280
The capital city is not a good place.

42:30.380 --> 42:32.490
The late emperor died there.

42:33.100 --> 42:35.370
Your mom died there.

42:35.770 --> 42:40.080
You can live longer if you stay in Danzhou.

43:11.280 --> 43:14.860
In the river of history,

43:14.880 --> 43:18.350
time goes round and round.

43:21.160 --> 43:24.500
Memories about the former and present lives

43:24.520 --> 43:28.590
join each other in an endless way.

43:30.480 --> 43:33.100
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:33.120 --> 43:35.360
one season follows another in a flash,

43:35.360 --> 43:37.860
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:37.880 --> 43:39.480
I just can't give up

43:39.480 --> 43:42.820
to be with you for my whole life.

43:42.840 --> 43:48.310
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:49.560 --> 43:52.110
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:52.400 --> 43:54.440
Year after year in the wandering,

43:54.440 --> 43:57.100
I count the remaining years.

43:57.120 --> 43:59.300
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:59.320 --> 44:01.310
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:01.600 --> 44:03.990
I never feel regretful.

44:04.040 --> 44:05.400
In such a chaotic world,

44:05.400 --> 44:08.380
I still miss you as ever.

44:08.400 --> 44:11.350
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:11.640 --> 44:13.700
With a gentle heart,

44:13.720 --> 44:16.380
I cherish our remaining years.

44:16.400 --> 44:17.920
Even though we have to go through

44:17.920 --> 44:20.430
all the hardships along the journey,

44:20.560 --> 44:27.750
you always stay by my side,

44:27.840 --> 44:30.510
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:30.800 --> 44:32.880
Year after year in the wandering,

44:32.880 --> 44:35.540
I count the remaining years.

44:35.560 --> 44:37.700
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:37.720 --> 44:39.950
even though we end up the destiny,

44:40.160 --> 44:42.340
I never feel regretful.

44:42.360 --> 44:43.760
In such a chaotic world,

44:43.760 --> 44:46.820
I still miss you as ever.

44:46.840 --> 44:49.950
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:50.040 --> 44:52.180
With a gentle heart,

44:52.200 --> 44:54.900
I cherish our remaining years.

44:54.920 --> 44:56.360
Even though we have to go through

44:56.360 --> 44:59.020
all the hardships along the journey,

44:59.040 --> 45:07.800
you always stay by my side...
